  "answer_text": "It looks like you're trying to visit **www.home.fedex.com/express**, which appears to be an older or alternate FedEx URL. The current and correct FedEx website has consolidated its services at **[www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com)**. Here's a summary of what you can find on the FedEx website:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\ude9a FedEx \u2013 Key Features & Services\n\n**General:**\nYou can use FedEx.com to log in to your FedEx account, get your tracking status, find a FedEx near you, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83d\udce6 FedEx Express (Expedited Shipping):**\nExpedited shipping is a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline, whether it's across town or on a global scale. This fast shipping service accommodates a range of items, from individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight.\n\nWhen delivery tomorrow won't cut it, consider **FedEx SameDay\u00ae**.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udfe0 FedEx Home Delivery:**\nWith FedEx Home Delivery, you can get day-definite home delivery \u2014 even on evenings and Saturdays.\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days** every day of the week, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n\n---\n\n**\ud83c\udf0d International Shipping:**\nExpand your reach to **130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83d\udd0d Tracking:**\nEnter your FedEx tracking number, track by reference, obtain proof of delivery, or TCN. See FedEx Express, Ground, Freight, and Custom Critical tracking services.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd17 Useful Direct Links:\n| Service | URL |\n|---|---|\n| FedEx Home | [fedex.com/en-us/home.html](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html) |\n| FedEx Express | [fedex.com/en-us/shipping/express.html](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/shipping/express.html) |\n| FedEx Tracking | [fedex.com/en-us/tracking.html](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/tracking.html) |\n| FedEx Home Delivery | [fedex.com/en-us/shipping/home-delivery.html](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/shipping/home-delivery.html) |\n\nWould you like help with tracking a package, finding shipping rates, or anything else related to FedEx?",
